  "description": "§4.11 (TS19): ClearTripDestinations asks GetLot(x, z, true), which answers only at the lot's origin, so the 2 x 2 lot (2,2)-(3,3) with max[0] = 6 and arrivedThisCycle[0] = 4 is rolled once (arrivedLast[0] = 4, not 0 from a second roll) and its capacity counted once (jobCapacity[0] = 6). RefreshCommuteMap sets bit 0 at all four cells (GetLot false at the others) and counts freeDest[0] once.",
